    "caption": "🍏 iPhone 20 Pro may curve all four edges\n\nA video from insider Ice Universe shows a transparent panel with glass curved along all four edges. It has a thin, even black bezel and a Dynamic Island cutout.\n\nA Chinese social media post calls it the anniversary iPhone’s “four-sided curved glass.” The sample’s authenticity has not been confirmed.\n\nApple has not confirmed the design or the iPhone 20 Pro name. A 2027 release is also unconfirmed.\n\n📊@tech",
