    "caption": "🤖 GPT-6.2 Astra Cuts Costs\n\nAstra is 20% cheaper, with cached tokens down 60%. Sol keeps its price but improves enough to trail Astra by just 0.5 points on FrontierCode 2.0, at roughly 5 times lower execution cost.\n\nAstra set a new record on Agents’ Last Exam, beating GPT-6 Astra by 5.2 points at less than a third of its previous cost. Both models also improve coding, documents, spreadsheets, presentations, interfaces, 3D apps, and engineering simulations.\n\nAstra reached SOTA on Terminal-Bench-Science and Vals Science Index. It is OpenAI’s first public model rated High for accelerating AI research. Both models reached Critical in cybersecurity.\n\n📊@tech",
